<title>USA: Calumet Bancorp completes share buyback.</title>
<headline>Calumet Bancorp completes share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>DOLTON, Ill. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calumet Bancorp Inc said Friday that it completed its plan, announced on April 4, to repurchase 128,850 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>Calumet Bancorp is the holding company of Calumet Federal Savings and Loan Association of Chicago. At March 31, 1997, it had 2,238,147 shares ot common stock outstanding.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
